to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 4%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 4%</a>:</b> Passive: 4% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Doublestrike. (Doublestrike is a chance to score an additional hit with a melee attack.)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Grim%27s_Bracelet.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Grim%27s_Bracelet.png/420px-Grim%27s_Bracelet.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"323\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Grim%27s_Bracelet.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Grim%27s_Bracelet\" title=\"Item:Epic Grim&#39;s Bracelet\">Epic Grim's Bracelet</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>It seems one of Grim brothers (you're not sure which one) wore this bracelet around his wrist. Due to its size it will probably only fit around your neck.</i>\n<